# The Thornwood Forest - Entrance

The forest looms before you, a wall of ancient trees. The path leads south into the shadows between the trunks. Despite the fading daylight, the forest seems to exist in its own twilight.

The image shows the forest path -- deceptively peaceful, but you can feel the wrongness in the air.

<<if not $has_lantern>>
The path ahead is dark. You'll have a hard time navigating without a light source.
